"example"}, {"content": "Isn't it better to be safe than sorry?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You wouldn't want to start a fire or get a shock, would you? ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "proper ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "adapted or suitable to the purpose or circumstances; fit", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Don't you want to take the proper precautions to be safe while doing it?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about cleaning the house.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "precaution ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an action taken beforehand to protect against possible danger or failure", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Cleaning your house can be hazardous if you don't take the right precautions.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to wipe", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to rub, move, or pass (a cloth, for example) over a surface", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  For wiping floors, sinks and tiles, you may want to use chemical cleaners.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "detrimental ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "can cause harm", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This can produce toxic fumes that can be detrimental to your health. Wouldn't you prefer not to end up in emergency?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tedious ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "boring; time-consuming", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Cleaning can be a very tedious task.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "childproof ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "made safe so young children cannot get into", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Make sure that they are up high or in a cupboard with a childproof lock.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "label ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an item used to identify something or someone, as a small piece of paper or cloth attached to an article to designate its origin, owner, contents, use, or destination", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: First, check the label of the detergents.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fumes ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "vapour, gas, or smoke, especially if irritating, harmful, or strong", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This can produce toxic fumes that can be detrimental to your health. Wouldn't you prefer not to end up in emergency?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online and find out what recipes are available for non-toxic cleaners for your house.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take some notes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the notes to write up summaries for three cleaning alternatives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read these to an adult you know and find out what they think of these cleaners and whether they would be interested in trying them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Bring your recipes and comments to class.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share the findings with a partner and discuss them.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": " I look up alternative non-toxic recipes for household cleaners.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write summaries on my findings for three cleaners.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask an adult for their opinion on them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my recipe and comments made by the adult with a partner and discuss them.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "rubber gloves", "type": "name"}, {"content": "gloves made out of rubber worn to protect the hands while performing tasks involving chemicals", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You might also want to wear rubber gloves.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "Cleaning can be a very tedious task, don't you think? You need to know how to clean and what to use to do it. Cleaning can be dangerous too. Don't you want to take the proper precautions to be safe while doing it? Of course you do. Here are some tips to make sure your cleaning experience is a positive one.\nFor wiping floors, sinks and tiles, you may want to use chemical cleaners. First, check the label. Use the correct amount. Too little won't clean properly. Too much can be toxic or hurt your hands. You might also want to wear rubber gloves."}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "time": "34000", "text": "Don't mix cleaners together. This can produce toxic fumes that can be detrimental to your health. Wouldn't you prefer not to end up in emergency?\nLeaving cleaners accessible if you have children is also a big hazard. Don't you agree? Make sure that they are up high or in a cupboard with a childproof lock."}, {"image": "", "id": 3, "time": "52000", "text": "Vacuuming can also pose a risk if not handled correctly. Plug it into an outlet that isn't overcrowded. You wouldn't want to start a fire or get a shock, would you? Move things out of the way so you don't trip. Pick up anything that could block the vacuum hose when sucked in, such as pins, or cotton balls! You don't want to have to get your vacuum repaired, do you?\nCleaning your house can be hazardous if you don't take the right precautions. So, isn't it better to be safe than sorry?"}], "video_src": "engenn9le07ob05re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about domestic activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about solving problems and explain how to do things.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can encourage agreement.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What types of chemical cleaners do you use at home to do housework?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Would you consider changing to a non-toxic cleaner? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "What chemical cleaners do you use at home?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [2], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Don't mix chemical cleaners and end up in <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">emergency</span>!", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"content": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\"Emergency\"</span> or the ER is the room you go to at the hospital when you feel ill or have hurt yourself. ", "type": "text", "tip_id": 0}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to watch the video.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "type": "STI", "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}]}, {"id": 2, "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nDon't you think that cleaning can be tedious?\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"conte